    "name": "9A-91-Xmas",
    "category": "Assault Rifle",
    "descriptionEn": "\"9A-91-Xmas is a limited edition of the 9A-91. This 9A-91 is locked and loaded for the Christmas celebration.\" This weapon has the Christmas texture which is mainly red and white with many colorful dots and the \"Merry Chirstmas\" texture on it. It has the same stats with the original 9A-91 such as its compact design, very fast firing rate, and high accuracy; furthermore, it also has an additional spare magazine, making it more effective.",
