    "name": "AK47-Knife Asgard",
    "category": "Assault Rifle",
    "descriptionEn": "The weapon is a customized version of the AK47 Knife with a unique design like any VVIP AK47s. The weapon features a fade-to-purple texture at the bayonet, magazine and the body (similar to Gradation WS). The theme is Heaven and Hell with an Angel figure protruding towards the player on the top metal side, and a Demon figure above the magazine on the gradient portion.",
