    "id": "4df3c267-1dee-4bd0-9b61-2db3c218963d",
    "name": "AR-50A1",
    "category": "Assault Rifle",
    "descriptionEn": "AR-50A1 takes after Falcon OP-99 for its extreme firepower and limited ammo capacity. This gun has the lowest ammo capacity among all sniper rifles, having only one single bullet in its chamber so players would need to constantly reload after every shot (unless the player boosts it with VVIP sniper rifle).",
