    "name": "AR-57",
    "category": "Assault Rifle",
    "descriptionEn": "AR-57 basically is an upper receiver for the AR-15/M16 rifle lower receiver, firing 5.7×28mm rounds from a standard P90 magazines. It comes with a holographic sight, but unusable. Static wise, this gun has moderately good firepower and acceptable accuracy when firing in short-burst, but the recoil becomes uncontrollable when spraying for too long, and its draw/reload speed is only mediocre.",
