    "descriptionEn": "This grenade features a unique polygonal-shape with greenish skin color, with a Nuclear sticker on top. It is the main weapon of Assassin in Mutation Mode. When explode, Assassin Grenade generates a blasting noise that can deafen soldiers' hearing for a brief moment, masking certain sound effect such as Evil Terminator's roar when throwing fireballs.",
