    "name": "Broken Kukri-Red Crystal",
    "category": "Melee",
    "descriptionEn": "Red crystal variant of the Kukri that broke due to suppressing many enemies at once. Its range has been shortened but can still slash enemies in an instant. This variant is different from the other variants of the Kukri since the top of the weapon is broken, although it is still usable to kill opponents in-game. Compared to the original Kukri, this one has a shorter attack range (but longer than the BC-Axe) and notably weaker (unable to kill unarmored opponents with a left click). However, the secondary attack still scores one-hit-kill anywhere on the body.",
