    "name": "Broomstick-Halloween",
    "category": "Assault Rifle",
    "descriptionEn": "This weapon features a black and orange color scheme with various Halloween themed drawing on its body, including bats, cats, moons, and pumpkins. Static-wise, Broomstick-Halloween functions like the Machete with quick swing (Primary) and heavy downward swing (Secondary), but it features a unique draw animation where player character takes the Broomstick out with their left hand and throw it to their right hand.",
