    "descriptionEn": "As its name suggest, the C4 is made of two sticks of C4 explosive taped together, and they're wired to an electronic timer with a keypad that allows the users to setup a delayed timer before it triggers. It can be selected by pressing 5, and can be dropped by pressing G (alternately, it'll automatically drop if the holder was killed). C4 will be given randomly to one player of the Black List side.",
