    "descriptionEn": "The Colt Canada C7A2 rifle is a Canadian assault rifle, manufactured by Colt Canada (formerly Diemaco), a variant of the AR-15 and having similar design and function to the Colt M16A2 and C8 assault rifle. This gun also comes with a C79A2 Optical Sight and painted with military green finish on its scope, hand-guard, stock and grip just like the color of AK5C.",
