    "category": "Assault Rifle",
    "descriptionEn": "Like the name, this is a pair of gloves assembled as a cat's paws. The primary attack consists of light scratch, which takes 3 hits in the body or 2 hits in the head to take down the enemy. The secondary attack consists of heavy dual scratch, which deals high damage but require precise hit to kill in one scratch. Like Glass Bead, this weapon supports players to jump easier in Parkour Mode.",
