    "descriptionEn": "The third sniper rifle to be featured in the VVIP System after AWM and M82A1, CheyTac M200-Dominator is given a unique techno skin with a black-gold color scheme and neon lights on its body which can change color depending on mode and usage status. It comes with a whopping 15 rounds magazine (+8), a slightly faster bolt cycling speed, and full wallbang damage, giving it an edge against other M200 variants.",
